# OriginAlternative$ Graveyard (ChangeZoneEffect.java:939-970): the "search
# your library?" prompt is declined, which leaves the graveyard as the only
# zone, searched without a second question and before Optional$ is asked.
# Ajani comes from the graveyard; no library was searched, so it is not
# shuffled ("If you search your library this way, shuffle", :1522).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 W
tapformana human 5 W
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric W
queue optionaltrigger true
queue confirmeffect false
queue confirmeffect true
queue cardchoice 6
castspell human 1
resolvestack
